Pomelo: on-device DevTools on phones.

Enables features::kAndroidDevToolsFrontend and drops the tablet form-factor
gate in DevToolsWindowAndroid (isNonMultiDisplayContextOnTablet). More tools
shows Developer tools and Inspect. The bundled frontend gets a phone viewport
meta after it opens. Written against the M158 sources; not derived from GPL
browser patches.
